18699182,2026-01-13,Mortgage,Conventional home mortgage,Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage,Trying to communicate with the company to fix an issue with the application process,"To Whom It May Concern, This correspondence serves as formal notice of an unauthorized loan application and credit inquiry initiated by PennyMac without my consent. 

